---
// Drie schermen uit de app, nagebouwd: kijken, nadoen, gehaald.
const check = 'M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5';
---
<ol class="three phones">
  <li>
    <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="screen screen-dark">
        <span class="small">Les 1 · Vingeralfabet</span>
        <span class="big-letter">A</span>
        <span class="example"><img src="/handen/a.webp" alt="" width="150" height="150" /></span>
        <span class="instr">Vuist, met de duim langs de zijkant</span>
        <span class="fake-btn">Doe het na</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <h3 class="heading">Kijken</h3>
      <p>Een voorbeeld van het gebaar, opgenomen door een gebarentaalvakman.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="screen screen-night">
        <span class="screen-title">Doe het na!</span>
        <span class="camera"><img src="/handen/a.webp" alt="" width="170" height="170" /></span>
        <span class="progress">
          <span class="dot dot-done"></span><span class="dot dot-done"></span><span class="dot"></span>
          <span>2 van 3 keer goed</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <h3 class="heading">Nadoen</h3>
      <p>De camera kijkt mee en ziet of de handvorm klopt. Er wordt niets opgenomen.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="screen screen-dark">
        <span class="success"><svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1B1533" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={check}></path></svg></span>
        <span class="screen-title">Je hebt het gehaald!</span>
        <span class="path">
          <span class="node n-done">A</span>
          <span class="link"></span>
          <span class="node n-now">B</span>
          <span class="start">START</span>
          <span class="node n-locked">C</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <h3 class="heading">Gehaald</h3>
      <p>Drie keer goed en de les is gehaald. Op het leerpad gaat de volgende letter open.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ol>

<style>
  .phones { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
  .phone {
    width: 240px; height: 480px; border-radius: 36px; background: var(--night-deep);
    padding: 10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }
  .screen {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 28px; color: var(--ink-on-night);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 28px 18px; gap: 16px;
  }
  .screen > * { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .screen > .camera { flex-shrink: 1; }
  .screen-dark { background: var(--night-deep); }
  .screen-night { background: var(--night); }
  .small { font-size: 13px; color: #B6AAD4; font-weight: 600; }
  .big-letter { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1; }
  .example {
    width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--night);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .example img { width: 120px; height: 120px; }
  .instr { font-size: 14px; text-align: center; }
  .fake-btn {
    margin-top: auto; width: 100%; min-height: 44px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--coral); color: var(--on-accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .screen-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; }
  .camera {
    width: 100%; flex-grow: 1; border-radius: 20px; background: #3D3168;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .camera img { width: 150px; height: 150px; }
  .progress {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--night-deep); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .dot { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: #3D3168; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #8E80B5; }
  .dot-done { background: var(--clover); box-shadow: none; }
  .success {
    width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--clover);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .path { margin-top: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .path .node { width: 52px; height: 52px; font-size: 26px; }
  .n-done { background: var(--clover); color: var(--on-accent); }
  .n-now {
    width: 68px !important; height: 68px !important; font-size: 32px !important;
    background: var(--coral); color: var(--on-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--night-deep), 0 0 0 9px var(--coral);
  }
  .n-locked { background: #3D3168; color: #9B8BC4; }
  .link { width: 4px; height: 14px; background: #3D3168; border-radius: 2px; }
  .start { padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--on-accent); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
  .caption-block { text-align: center; max-width: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
</style>
